{"id":"77610c949b2c174a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-ultraproduct.md","title":"Ultraproduct","display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ultraproduct","aliases":["58-df-ultraproduct"],"display":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ultraproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ultraproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultraproduct — Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathfrak A_i:i\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathfrak A_i:i\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (nonempty structures in one first-order signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A_i)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A_i)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A_i)=A_i\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A_i)=A_i\\)</span> (universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (signature components, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\">\\(\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\)</span> (set of choice functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_U\">\\(\\sim_U\\)</span> (ultrafilter equivalence relation defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\">\\(\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\)</span> (ultraproduct structure defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct} \\vdash \\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in A_i)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct} \\vdash \\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\coloneqq\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in A_i)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash f\\sim_Ug\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash f\\sim_Ug\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\land\\{i\\in I:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathrm{Univ}\\!\\left(\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\right)\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\right)\\!/\\sim_U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)\\to\\mathrm{Univ}\\!\\left(\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i\\right)\\coloneqq\\left(\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\right)\\!/\\sim_U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}constant} \\vdash c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\to c^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}\\coloneqq\\bigl[i\\mapsto c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\bigr]_U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}constant} \\vdash c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\to c^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}\\coloneqq\\bigl[i\\mapsto c^{\\mathfrak A_i}\\bigr]_U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}relation} \\vdash n\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(f_j\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i)\\to\\Bigl(R^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}([f_1]_U,\\ldots,[f_n]_U)\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:R^{\\mathfrak A_i}(f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i))\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}relation} \\vdash n\\in\\omega\\land R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(f_j\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i)\\to\\Bigl(R^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}([f_1]_U,\\ldots,[f_n]_U)\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:R^{\\mathfrak A_i}(f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i))\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}function} \\vdash n\\in\\omega\\land F\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(f_j\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i)\\to F^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}([f_1]_U,\\ldots,[f_n]_U)\\coloneqq\\left[i\\mapsto F^{\\mathfrak A_i}(f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i))\\right]_U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultraproduct\\text{-}function} \\vdash n\\in\\omega\\land F\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(f_j\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i)\\to F^{\\prod_U\\mathfrak A_i}([f_1]_U,\\ldots,[f_n]_U)\\coloneqq\\left[i\\mapsto F^{\\mathfrak A_i}(f_1(i),\\ldots,f_n(i))\\right]_U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Completeness and nonprincipality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> are not part of the ultraproduct definition.</li>\n<li>The coordinatewise interpretations are well-defined on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_U\">\\(\\sim_U\\)</span>-classes because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is an ultrafilter.</li>\n<li>Preservation of first-order truth is Łoś's theorem, a downstream result.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A_i,\\mathcal L)$ for every $i\\in I$ (s